window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Werewolves are hunting me.</p> <p>I was just an ordinary girl waiting tables in a small-town bar. I had no idea magic was real. That was, until I backed my car over a werewolf a couple of times.</p> <p>In my defense, the wolf was trying to murder me, and I was all out of mace.</p> <p>Now I've got a cult of rogue shifters on my heels, and the only one who can protect me is a mysterious stranger, Jaxson Laurent—the leader of the Chicago pack. He's powerful and possessive and cant take his eyes off me, but he's the sworn enemy of my family. I want to push him away, but the heat between us is irresistible.</p> <p>I don't know who to trust: the dangerous alpha or the family I never knew I had.</p> <p>The Fates may not give me time to choose. With demons lurking in the shadows and wolves howling in the night, I'll need to master my magic and track down the rogue pack, or I'll be dead before the next moon rises.</p> <p>Savannah &amp; Jaxson, Books 1-4 (Complete Series)</p> <p>The Wolf Bound series is an action-packed, enemies-to-lovers urban fantasy with building steam and an HEA in book 4. It pits a kick-ass heroine and dangerous hero against a deepening conspiracy of rogue wolves, sorcerers, and the forces of a dark god.</p>"; 
